{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blood Curse Legion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you will play as the progenitor of vampires, leading your Blood Curse Legion to sweep across the world, establishing a vampire nation and dominating a region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is demo version:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players mainly control the vampire cavalry legion in combat, changing their formation according to different situations to maximize damage output and customize support formations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various types of troops:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shield infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raider infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranged troops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flying troops</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u00a0 will have about 10 battles in this version.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636090?t=1744292248","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636090/b2a54d650ac5bbd2d54208fe8180f40faa429394/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744292248","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636090/7755df1c88d7e0bc550a4d039f518786ddf4eb9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744292248","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636090/7755df1c88d7e0bc550a4d039f518786ddf4eb9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744292248","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blood Curse Legion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you will play as the progenitor of vampires, leading your Blood Curse Legion to sweep across the world, establishing a vampire nati